<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #111">
    <p>Hello,</p>
    <p>
      <strong>{{organizationName}}</strong> has been approved on
      <strong>{{appName}}</strong>.
    </p>
    <p>
      We created a dedicated account for the organization.
      <a href="{{activationUrl}}" style="color: #0b57d0">Set its password</a> —
      the link is valid for {{expiresInHours}} hours and can only be used once.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #444">{{activationUrl}}</p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #666">
      Sign in with this account to manage the organization's profile, members and
      campaigns. Keep it separate from personal accounts — everything done with it
      is recorded against the organization.
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
